## 33

写个二分查找的函数然后根据条件查找。

 模板代码：

```java
public int binSerach(int nums[], int left, int right, int target){
        if(left>right) return -1;

        int mid = (left+right)/2;
        if(nums[mid] == target){
            return mid;
        }else if(nums[mid] > target){
            return binSerach(nums, left, mid-1, target);
        }else{
            return binSerach(nums, mid+1, right, target);
        }
    }
}
```
